---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { STATUS_ICON } from "../lib/reviews";
import "../styles/review-card.css";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Panel administratora"
  description="Willa Ewa – panel administratora"
  navigation={{ title: "Panel", link: "main-page" }}
>
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex" slot="head" />

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════ INFO ═══════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="info">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-label">Zarządzanie opiniami</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Opinie z Google oraz ze strony</h2>
        <p class="section-lead">
          Panel administratora został stworzony aby uniknąć sytuacji, w której
          jakaś złośliwa opinia zostanie automatycznie dodana na stronę
          internetową. Każda opinia (z Google i ze strony) najpierw musi zostać
          zaakceptowana właśnie tutaj.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="info-content">
        <h3>Informacje</h3>
        <p>Wszystkie opinie mają jeden z następujących statusów:</p>
        <ul class="panel-list">
          <li>
            <div class="icon">
              <Fragment set:html={STATUS_ICON.pending} />
              <strong>Oczekująca</strong>
            </div>
            <p>
              Nowa opinia, czeka na decyzję administratora (nie wyświetla się na
              stronie).
            </p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <div class="icon">
              <Fragment set:html={STATUS_ICON.accepted} />
              <strong>Zaakceptowana</strong>
            </div>
            <p>Wyświetla się na stronie.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <div class="icon">
              <Fragment set:html={STATUS_ICON.deleted} />
              <strong>Usunięta</strong>
            </div>
            <p>Opinia usunięta (nie wyświetla się na stronie).</p>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Statusy wszystkich opini można dowolnie zmieniać. Jeżeli np. przez
          przypadek usunie się opinię, można ją przywrócić wchodząc w zakładkę
          usunięte.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════ REVIEWS ═══════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="reviews">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-label">Panel opini</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Oczekujące</h2>
        <p class="section-lead"></p>
      </div>
      <div class="status-filter" data-current-filter="pending">
        <button
          class="button-outline status-filter__btn--pending"
          data-filter="pending"
        >
          <Fragment set:html={STATUS_ICON.pending} />
          Oczekujące
        </button>
        <button
          class="button-outline status-filter__btn--accepted"
          data-filter="accepted"
        >
          <Fragment set:html={STATUS_ICON.accepted} />
          Zaakceptowane
        </button>
        <button
          class="button-outline status-filter__btn--deleted"
          data-filter="deleted"
        >
          <Fragment set:html={STATUS_ICON.deleted} />
          Usunięte
        </button>
        <button
          class="button-outline status-filter__btn--all"
          data-filter="all"
        >
          <Fragment set:html={STATUS_ICON.all} />
          Wszystkie
        </button>
      </div>
      <div class="reviews__grid"></div>
    </div>
    <button id="apply-changes" class="hidden">Zatwierdź zmiany:</button>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════ SANITY ═══════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="sanity-cms">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-label">Zarządzanie treścią</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Sanity Studio</h2>
        <p class="section-lead">
          Edytuj treść strony — zdjęcia, opisy, dane kontaktowe.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="info-content">
        <a
          href="https://www.sanity.io/@olDJ1uTaz/studio/pst2er4kcasxd158upm0ysmz/default/structure"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="sanity-link"
        >
          <svg
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            width="20"
            height="20"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
          >
            <path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"></path>
            <path
              d="M12 6h-6a2 2 0 0 0 -2 2v10a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2 -2v-6"
            ></path>
            <path d="M11 13l9 -9"></path><path d="M15 4h5v5"></path>
          </svg>
          Otwórz Sanity Studio
        </a>

        <h3>Co możesz zmienić</h3>
        <p>Poniższe nazwy znajdziesz w menu po lewej stronie Sanity Studio.</p>
        <ul class="panel-list">
          <li>
            <strong>Zdjęcia hero</strong>
            <p>
              Zdjęcia na samej górze strony, za napisem „Pokoje do wynajęcia w
              Krynicy Morskiej”. Każde zdjęcie możesz ustawić tak, żeby
              wyświetlało się tylko na telefonie albo tylko na komputerze.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Zdjęcia pokoi</strong>
            <p>Przewijane zdjęcia w sekcji „Nasza oferta”.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Galeria zdjęć</strong>
            <p>
              Zdjęcia w galerii. Pod każdym możesz dodać podpis i link (np. do
              Google Maps).
            </p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Ważne informacje</strong>
            <p>
              Lista w sekcji „Dobrze wiedzieć przed przyjazdem” — np. godziny
              zameldowania i opłata klimatyczna.
            </p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Ustawienia strony</strong>
            <p>Numery telefonów, e-mail, ceny i opis pokoi.</p>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <p class="cms-note">
          Zmiany pojawią się na stronie po kliknięciu <strong>Publish</strong>.
          Strona przebuduje się wtedy sama — trwa to około 1–2 minut.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ══════════════════════════════ ANALYTICS ═══════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="analytics">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-label">Analityka strony</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Ruch na stronie</h2>
        <p class="section-lead">
          Tu możesz zobaczyć ile osób wchodziło na stronę i dodatkowe statystyki
        </p>
      </div>
      <iframe src="https://cloud.umami.is/share/4lS7UlZQWCt7oA1n"></iframe>
    </div>
  </section>

  <script>
    import {
      formatReviewDate,
      getInitials,
      LONG_QUOTE_LENGTH,
      SOURCE_ICON,
      SOURCE_LABEL,
      STATUS_ICON,
      starsHtml,
      type ReviewSource,
      type ReviewStatus,
    } from "../lib/reviews";
    import escapeHtml from "escape-html";

    // Auth guard — runs before any DOM manipulation or data fetching.
    // Treats ANY non-200 (including 404 from the Astro dev server when Express
    // is not proxied) and network errors as unauthorized so the redirect always fires.
    const verifyRes = await fetch("/api/auth/verify").catch(() => null);
    if (!verifyRes?.ok) {
      window.location.replace("/login");
      throw new Error("unauthorized"); // halts further module execution
    }

    type StatusFilter = ReviewStatus | "all";

    interface Review {
      id: string;
      author: string;
      quote: string;
      rating: number;
      time: number;
      status: ReviewStatus;
      source: ReviewSource;
      reply?: string;
    }

    // Reviews are rendered via innerHTML below, and author/quote for
    // source: "page" reviews come straight from the public, unauthenticated
    // add-review form (only length/URL-checked, not HTML-checked) — escape
    // before interpolating so a malicious submission can't run script in
    // this authenticated admin session. Every user-submitted field below
    // goes through escapeHtml (from the escape-html package).

    // Bare fetch() has no default timeout — a request that never resolves
    // (dead connection, hung server) leaves callers stuck awaiting it
    // forever with no way to detect that. This aborts after timeoutMs so a
    // stuck request surfaces as a normal error instead of an infinite spinner.
    async function fetchWithTimeout(
      url: string,
      options: RequestInit,
      timeoutMs = 15000,
    ): Promise<Response> {
      const controller = new AbortController();
      const timer = setTimeout(() => controller.abort(), timeoutMs);
      try {
        return await fetch(url, { ...options, signal: controller.signal });
      } finally {
        clearTimeout(timer);
      }
    }

    let currentStatusFilter: StatusFilter = "pending";
    const reviewsSectionTitle = document.querySelector(
      ".reviews .section-title",
    );
    const statusFilterElement = document.querySelector(".status-filter");
    const reviewsContainerElement = document.querySelector(".reviews__grid")!;

    const statusNamePl: Record<StatusFilter, string> = {
      all: "Wszystkie",
      pending: "Oczekujące",
      accepted: "Zaakceptowane",
      deleted: "Usunięte",
    };

    const pendingChanges = new Map<string, ReviewStatus>();
    const applyChangesButton = document.querySelector("#apply-changes")!;
    applyChangesButton.addEventListener("click", () => applyChanges());

    statusFilterElement?.addEventListener("click", (e) => {
      const button = (e.target as HTMLElement).closest<HTMLElement>(
        "button[data-filter]",
      );
      if (button) changeStatusFilter(button.dataset.filter as StatusFilter);
    });

    function changeStatusFilter(filter: StatusFilter) {
      if (currentStatusFilter === filter) return;
      currentStatusFilter = filter;
      statusFilterElement?.setAttribute("data-current-filter", filter);
      if (reviewsSectionTitle)
        reviewsSectionTitle.textContent = statusNamePl[filter];
      renderReviews();
    }

    async function fetchReviews(): Promise<Review[]> {
      const res = await fetch("/api/admin/get-reviews");
      if (!res.ok) {
        if (res.status === 401 || res.status === 403) {
          window.location.replace("/login");
          throw new Error("Unauthorized");
        }
        alert("Błąd podczas pobierania opini z serwera");
        throw new Error("Błąd pobierania recenzji");
      }
      const data = (await res.json()) as { reviews: Review[] };
      return data.reviews;
    }

    let allReviews = await fetchReviews();
    renderReviews();

    function renderReviews() {
      const filtered =
        currentStatusFilter === "all"
          ? allReviews
          : allReviews.filter((r) => r.status === currentStatusFilter);
      reviewsContainerElement.innerHTML = filtered.length
        ? filtered.map(renderReview).join("")
        : `<p class="reviews__empty">Brak opinii z tym statusem</p>`;
    }

    reviewsContainerElement.addEventListener("click", (e) => {
      const target = e.target as HTMLElement;

      const toggleBtn = target.closest(".review-toggle") as HTMLElement | null;
      if (toggleBtn) {
        const quote = toggleBtn.previousElementSibling;
        const expanded = quote?.classList.toggle("expanded");
        toggleBtn.textContent = expanded ? "Zwiń" : "Czytaj więcej";
        return;
      }

      const hardDeleteBtn = target.closest(
        ".review-card__hard-delete",
      ) as HTMLElement | null;
      if (hardDeleteBtn) {
        const card = hardDeleteBtn.closest(".review-card") as HTMLElement;
        const id = card?.dataset.id;
        const review = allReviews.find((r) => r.id === id);
        if (review) showDeleteConfirm(review);
        return;
      }

      const replySaveBtn = target.closest(
        ".review-card__reply-save",
      ) as HTMLButtonElement | null;
      if (replySaveBtn) {
        const card = replySaveBtn.closest(".review-card") as HTMLElement;
        const id = card?.dataset.id;
        const textarea = card?.querySelector<HTMLTextAreaElement>(
          ".review-card__reply-input",
        );
        if (id && textarea)
          saveReply(id, textarea.value, replySaveBtn, textarea);
        return;
      }

      const statusBtn = target.closest<HTMLElement>("button[data-status]");
      if (!statusBtn) return;

      const card = statusBtn.closest(".review-card") as HTMLElement;
      if (!card) return;

      const id = card.dataset.id;
      const newStatus = statusBtn.dataset.status as ReviewStatus;

      if (id) {
        const review = allReviews.find((r) => r.id === id);
        if (!review) return;
        if (newStatus === review.status) {
          pendingChanges.delete(id);
          card.removeAttribute("data-pending-status");
        } else {
          pendingChanges.set(id, newStatus);
          card.setAttribute("data-pending-status", newStatus);
        }
      }
      updateApplyButton();
    });

    function updateApplyButton() {
      const count = pendingChanges.size;
      if (count === 0) {
        applyChangesButton.classList.add("hidden");
      } else {
        applyChangesButton.classList.remove("hidden");
        applyChangesButton.textContent = `Zatwierdź zmiany: ${count} ${count === 1 ? "opinia" : count < 5 ? "opinie" : "opinii"}`;
      }
    }

    async function applyChanges() {
      if (pendingChanges.size === 0) return;
      const changes = Array.from(pendingChanges, ([id, status]) => ({
        id,
        status,
      }));
      const res = await fetch("/api/admin/change-statuses", {
        method: "POST",
        headers: { "Content-Type": "application/json" },
        body: JSON.stringify({ reviews: changes }),
      });
      if (!res.ok) {
        alert("Błąd zapisywania zmian");
        return;
      }
      for (const [id, status] of pendingChanges) {
        const review = allReviews.find((r) => r.id === id);
        if (review) review.status = status;
      }
      pendingChanges.clear();
      updateApplyButton();
      renderReviews();
      alert("Udało się zaktualizować status opini");
    }

    function showDeleteConfirm(review: Review): void {
      document.querySelector(".delete-confirm-overlay")?.remove();
      const overlay = document.createElement("div");
      overlay.className = "delete-confirm-overlay";
      overlay.innerHTML = `
        <div class="delete-confirm-dialog">
          <h3>Czy na pewno chcesz usunąć tę opinię?</h3>
          <div class="delete-confirm-details">
            <table>
              <tr><td>Autor</td><td><strong>${escapeHtml(review.author)}</strong></td></tr>
              <tr><td>Ocena</td><td><div class="stars">${starsHtml(review.rating)}</div></td></tr>
              <tr><td>Data</td><td>${formatReviewDate(review.time)}</td></tr>
              <tr><td>Treść</td><td class="delete-confirm-details__quote">${escapeHtml(review.quote)}</td></tr>
            </table>
          </div>
          <p class="delete-confirm-warning">Tej operacji nie można cofnąć.</p>
          <div class="delete-confirm-actions">
            <button class="delete-confirm__no">Nie</button>
            <button class="delete-confirm__yes">Tak, usuń trwale</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      `;
      overlay
        .querySelector(".delete-confirm__no")
        ?.addEventListener("click", () => overlay.remove());
      overlay.addEventListener("click", (e) => {
        if (e.target === overlay) overlay.remove();
      });
      overlay
        .querySelector(".delete-confirm__yes")
        ?.addEventListener("click", async () => {
          await permanentlyDeleteReview(review.id);
          overlay.remove();
        });
      document.body.appendChild(overlay);
    }

    async function permanentlyDeleteReview(id: string): Promise<void> {
      const res = await fetch(`/api/admin/reviews/${id}`, { method: "DELETE" });
      if (!res.ok) {
        alert("Błąd podczas usuwania opinii");
        return;
      }
      allReviews = allReviews.filter((r) => r.id !== id);
      renderReviews();
    }

    async function saveReply(
      id: string,
      replyValue: string,
      button: HTMLButtonElement,
      textarea: HTMLTextAreaElement,
    ): Promise<void> {
      const originalLabel = button.textContent;
      button.disabled = true;
      textarea.disabled = true;
      button.textContent = "Zapisywanie…";
      try {
        const res = await fetchWithTimeout(`/api/admin/reviews/${id}`, {
          method: "PATCH",
          headers: { "Content-Type": "application/json" },
          body: JSON.stringify({ reply: replyValue }),
        });
        if (!res.ok) {
          alert("Błąd zapisywania odpowiedzi");
          return;
        }
        const review = allReviews.find((r) => r.id === id);
        const trimmed = replyValue.trim();
        if (review) review.reply = trimmed || undefined;
        renderReviews();
        alert(trimmed ? "Zapisano odpowiedź" : "Usunięto odpowiedź");
      } catch (err) {
        alert(
          err instanceof DOMException && err.name === "AbortError"
            ? "Przekroczono czas oczekiwania na odpowiedź serwera — spróbuj ponownie"
            : "Błąd połączenia — spróbuj ponownie",
        );
      } finally {
        // No-op if the card was already re-rendered (success path) — these
        // nodes are detached by then. Only matters for the error path,
        // where the same card stays in the DOM and needs to be usable again.
        button.disabled = false;
        textarea.disabled = false;
        button.textContent = originalLabel;
      }
    }

    function renderReview(review: Review): string {
      const pendingStatus = pendingChanges.get(review.id);
      const pendingAttr = pendingStatus
        ? `data-pending-status="${pendingStatus}"`
        : "";
      const isLong = review.quote.length > LONG_QUOTE_LENGTH;

      return `
        <div class="review-card${isLong ? " long-quote" : ""}" data-status="${review.status}" data-id="${review.id}" ${pendingAttr}>
          <div class="review-card__source">
            <div class="review-card__source-logo-wrap">
              <div class="review-card__source-logo">${SOURCE_ICON[review.source]}</div>
              <span class="review-card__source-name">${SOURCE_LABEL[review.source]}</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stars">${starsHtml(review.rating)}</div>
          </div>
          ${review.quote ? `<blockquote class="review-card__quote">„${escapeHtml(review.quote)}"</blockquote>` : ""}
          ${isLong ? `<button class="review-toggle">Czytaj więcej</button>` : ""}
          <div class="review-card__bottom">
            <div class="review-card__author">
              <div class="review-card__avatar" aria-hidden="true">${escapeHtml(getInitials(review.author))}</div>
              <div>
                <p class="review-card__name">${escapeHtml(review.author)}</p>
                <p class="review-card__date">${formatReviewDate(review.time)}</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="review-card__controls">
              <div class="status-picker">
                ${(["accepted", "pending", "deleted"] as const)
                  .map(
                    (status) =>
                      `<button class="status-picker__btn--${status}" data-status="${status}">${STATUS_ICON[status]}</button>`,
                  )
                  .join("")}
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          ${
            review.source === "page"
              ? `<div class="review-card__reply">
                  <label for="reply-${review.id}">Odpowiedź</label>
                  <textarea id="reply-${review.id}" class="review-card__reply-input" placeholder="Napisz odpowiedź na tę opinię…">${escapeHtml(review.reply ?? "")}</textarea>
                  <button type="button" class="review-card__reply-save">${review.reply ? "Zapisz odpowiedź" : "Dodaj odpowiedź"}</button>
                </div>`
              : ""
          }
          ${
            currentStatusFilter === "deleted" && review.source === "page"
              ? `<button class="review-card__hard-delete">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"/><path d="M4 7h16"/><path d="M5 7l1 12a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h8a2 2 0 0 0 2 -2l1 -12"/><path d="M9 7v-3a1 1 0 0 1 1 -1h4a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3"/><path d="M10 12l4 4m0 -4l-4 4"/></svg>
                  Usuń trwale
                </button>`
              : ""
          }
        </div>
      `;
    }
  </script>

  <!-- Global: most of the panel is rendered by the script above (innerHTML),
       which scoped styles don't reach. Only loaded on this page. -->
  <style is:global>
    /* ── Info section ─────────────────────────────────────────── */
    .info {
      margin-block-start: var(--space-xl);
    }

    .info .section-header {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .info-content {
      margin-top: var(--space-xl);
    }

    .info-content h3 {
      font-size: var(--font-size-xl);
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-weight: var(--weight-light);
      margin: 0;
    }

    .info-content > p {
      font-size: var(--font-size-m);
      color: var(--c-font-secondary);
    }

    /* Bordered rows: status legend, CMS sections */
    .panel-list {
      list-style: none;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      margin-block: var(--space-l);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: start;
      gap: var(--space-s);
    }

    .panel-list li {
      margin: 0;
      padding: var(--space-m);
      width: 100%;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: start;
      border: 1px solid var(--c-font-primary);
    }

    .panel-list .icon {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: row;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    /* text lines up with the label, past the icon */
    .panel-list .icon + p {
      margin-inline-start: var(--space-xl);
    }

    /* ── Status filter ────────────────────────────────────────── */
    .status-filter {
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--c-border-light);
      padding-bottom: 16px;
      display: grid;
      grid-auto-flow: row;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(10rem, 1fr));
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .status-filter .button-outline {
      padding: 12px;
      border: 1px solid var(--c-border-light);
      color: var(--c-border-light);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: row;
      gap: 4px;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .status-filter[data-current-filter="pending"] .status-filter__btn--pending,
    .status-filter[data-current-filter="accepted"]
      .status-filter__btn--accepted,
    .status-filter[data-current-filter="deleted"] .status-filter__btn--deleted,
    .status-filter[data-current-filter="all"] .status-filter__btn--all {
      border: 1px solid var(--c-font-accent);
      color: var(--c-font-primary);
      box-shadow: 0px 1px 2px var(--c-font-accent);
    }

    .reviews__empty {
      color: var(--c-font-secondary);
      margin-block-start: var(--space-l);
    }

    /* ── Reviews section ──────────────────────────────────────── */
    .reviews {
      background-color: var(--c-bg-secondary);
      padding-bottom: 200px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--c-border-light);
    }

    .reviews__grid {
      margin-block-start: 32px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: var(--space-l);
    }

    /* ── Review card (base styles: styles/review-card.css) ───── */
    .review-card[data-pending-status] {
      border: 1px solid var(--c-font-primary);
    }

    /* ── Review card bottom (admin-specific) ──────────────────── */
    .review-card__bottom {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--c-border-light);
      padding-top: 16px;
      width: 100%;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
